Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.39-rt59 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.39 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: 1f5e9a5685c9596d9fc28018608ee9385c060b9e


Or to build 3.2.39-rt59 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.39.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.39-rt59.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve



